WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:02.125
- I gotta ask: how did you four survive?

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.375
- WE DON’T TALK ABOUT WHAT HAPPENED AT DIVISIONALS.

00:00:04.958 --> 00:00:06.500
- Hey, babe, let's close your window.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.416
- Don't you dareeeeee.

00:00:08.791 --> 00:00:09.708
- Dad, get me out of here.
- [Yelling, commotion]

00:00:09.708 --> 00:00:10.500
- Goddamn Jets.
- Goshdarn Jets.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.375
- WHEN WE CRASH, IT’S IMPORTANT TO LEAD WITH YOUR HEAD.

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:16.375
- OK, not QUITE the game script.

00:00:16.541 --> 00:00:17.500
- We need to eat the weak.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.125
- Already?
- We just crashed.

00:00:21.791 --> 00:00:24.000
- Why is everyone worried? Derrick will carry us all to safety.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.500
- How did you all survive while I was gone?

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:26.291
- WEEEE.

00:00:26.916 --> 00:00:29.250
- I decide where Gronk goes. Always.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.875
- So Brady gets to have a shirtless outburst?

00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:32.250
- I have a genius plan.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.750
Aaron Donald, go do things!

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.750
- I’D STILL LOVE A JERSEY SWAP.

00:00:35.916 --> 00:00:36.916
- Green 17!

00:00:36.916 --> 00:00:39.500
- Uh, yikes. Not looking so good for Mike McDaniel.

00:00:39.625 --> 00:00:41.750
- Sorry, the lance isn't quite ready.

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:44.416
- Yo, did we crash? Sorry, I don’t feel turbulence.

00:00:44.541 --> 00:00:46.375
- ONCE AGAIN, I MUST THIN THE HERD.

00:00:46.625 --> 00:00:48.791
- COMMON MISTAKE, BUT I’M A HUMAN MAN.

00:00:48.791 --> 00:00:51.375
- Oh, Lord, what’s the conference round like?

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.375
- Welcome to your nightmare…

00:00:53.375 --> 00:00:54.291
It's a Zac Trap, y'all!

00:00:54.583 --> 00:00:57.250
- Ugh, how the f--k am I gonna spin this to McAfee on Tuesday?

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:58.625
- ALL HAIL...

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:00.250
Ok...let's see...uhh...

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:00.916
Mahomes.

00:01:00.916 --> 00:01:01.375
- YAY!

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:04.125
They're in a better place now.

00:01:04.375 --> 00:01:05.166
The Pro Bowl.

00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:10.666
- Doing great, Big Mac. Just gotta keep flying thus bad boy down the—

00:01:10.666 --> 00:01:12.875
- I'm going to run it into the ground.

00:01:13.041 --> 00:01:13.666
- WAIT, NO!

00:01:13.791 --> 00:01:16.708
- I stand by this as a good decision.

